  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="uganda.html">Uganda</a> / Women-Only Uganda Gorilla Journey</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">Our sisterhood departure to the heart of the "pearl of Africa" — the lions and elephants of Queen Elizabeth and an unforgettable hour with the mountain gorillas of Bwindi, in an intimate group of 8–12 women led by a female host.</p>
        <p>Vetted lodges, thoughtful pacing and real connection — including time with the women's groups our community partners support. Come solo and leave with friends.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
