  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 8-day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Arrive &amp; gather in Entebbe</h3><p>Met at the airport and welcomed to a lake-shore hotel, where the group comes together over a welcome dinner with your host.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Entebbe lake hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly to Queen Elizabeth</h3><p>A light-aircraft flight west to Queen Elizabeth National Park, with an afternoon game drive among elephant, buffalo and kob.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Queen Elizabeth lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Kazinga &amp; tree-climbing lions</h3><p>A morning game drive in search of the Ishasha tree-climbing lions, then an afternoon cruise on the wildlife-lined Kazinga Channel.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Queen Elizabeth lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>South to Bwindi</h3><p>A scenic drive into the terraced hills to the edge of the Bwindi Impenetrable Forest, settling in for the encounter to come.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Bwindi forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Gorilla trekking in Bwindi</h3><p>The day you came for — a hike into the ancient forest with trackers ahead, and a magical, regulated hour with a mountain gorilla family.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Bwindi forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Community &amp; women's groups</h3><p>A warm morning with a Bwindi women's cooperative — weaving, tea and shared stories — and an optional second gorilla permit for those who wish.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Bwindi forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 7</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Lake Bunyonyi</h3><p>A short drive to the terraced shores of Lake Bunyonyi — a restful day of canoes, birdsong and reflection together.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Lake Bunyonyi lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 8</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly home together</h3><p>A morning by the lake, then a light-aircraft flight back to Entebbe — new friendships and a fuller heart for the journey home.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
